# WhisperX rows for the shared huggingface data table.
# Column conventions: https://docs.galaxyproject.org/en/latest/admin/data_tables.html
#
# Columns: value <TAB> name <TAB> pipeline_tag <TAB> domain <TAB> free_tag <TAB> version <TAB> path
#
#   value        : Hugging Face model ID (passed to whisperx --model)
#   pipeline_tag : automatic-speech-recognition
#   domain       : audio
#   free_tag     : faster-whisper (CTranslate2 conversions of Whisper; other
#                  Whisper formats, e.g. openai/whisper-large-v3, do not load)
#   version      : 1
#   path         : model root directory created by download_models.py
#                  (the directory that contains hub/)
#
# The same root also holds the models WhisperX loads without a user choice,
# so they have no rows here: the alignment model for each language and the
# pyannote diarization model, plus NLTK punkt_tab. download_models.py
# downloads all of them.
#
# To configure:
# 1. Run download_models.py inside the tool's container (see the command at
#    the top of the script), with /data/db/whisperx_models mounted; the
#    models need about 60 GB
# 2. Copy the rows below, without the leading '#', to the huggingface.loc
#    you share with other tools, and replace /data/db/whisperx_models with that
#    directory. They are commented out so that installing the tool from a Tool
#    Shed does not add rows with this placeholder path to the table
# 3. Keep value as the Hugging Face ID: the tool passes it to --model, so a
#    renamed value cannot be loaded. Rows of other tools with the same value
#    are filtered out by free_tag; of two faster-whisper rows with the same
#    value, Galaxy uses the first
#
#mobiuslabsgmbh/faster-whisper-large-v3-turbo	Whisper large-v3 turbo (~8x faster than large)	automatic-speech-recognition	audio	faster-whisper	1	/data/db/whisperx_models
#Systran/faster-whisper-tiny	Whisper tiny (~10x faster than large)	automatic-speech-recognition	audio	faster-whisper	1	/data/db/whisperx_models
#Systran/faster-whisper-base	Whisper base (~7x faster than large)	automatic-speech-recognition	audio	faster-whisper	1	/data/db/whisperx_models
#Systran/faster-whisper-small	Whisper small (~4x faster than large)	automatic-speech-recognition	audio	faster-whisper	1	/data/db/whisperx_models
#Systran/faster-whisper-medium	Whisper medium (~2x faster than large)	automatic-speech-recognition	audio	faster-whisper	1	/data/db/whisperx_models
#Systran/faster-whisper-large-v3	Whisper large-v3	automatic-speech-recognition	audio	faster-whisper	1	/data/db/whisperx_models
